WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.200
Robots need structured demonstrations of people transforming real spaces.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:21.500
WorkTrace turns authorized physical work into traceable robotics data.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:36.700
Each job begins with site authorization, worker opt-in, audio off, and a safety check.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:51.900
Reviewers verify annotations and exclude sensitive footage before release.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:01:09.600
The proposed kit connects a brim-mounted UVC camera to an Android phone by USB-C.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:21.000
Adjacent verticals include hospitality, assembly, warehousing, laundry, and maintenance.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:42.500
International expansion matches tasks to markets, with skilled-work pay, a recording premium, local consent, and region-first raw storage.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:57.700
The recommended model pays the staging partner and every participating worker.

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:15.400
Sell a buyer-funded specification sprint, then raise only after measured customer value.
